 "_doc": "Fenrir, boss (GAME_DESIGN.md: Midgard's Edge bosses; art 10/31/2026). Built by tools/art/build_boss_fenrir.py; rules in docs/ART_RULES.md. From Snorri Sturluson's Prose Edda, Gylfaginning 34 and 51: the monstrous wolf, Loki's son, bound by the gods with Gleipnir, a fetter 'smooth and soft as a silken ribbon', who breaks free at Ragnarok and goes with his jaws gaping, the upper against the sky and the lower against the earth. A huge grey wolf on four legs, snarling (owner 10/31/2026: a first version with a long boxy body, gaping jaws and the broken ribbon of Gleipnir round his neck was redone).",
